 "final_message": "Intent to proceed is recorded with Brightpath Home Lending, and both underwriting conditions have a response. Application BHL-26001 is now \"In underwriting\".\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** It is within all three of your limits.\n\n  | Item | Loan Estimate | Your limit |\n  |---|---|---|\n  | Interest rate (30-year fixed) | 7.25% | 7.5% |\n  | Total monthly payment | $3,485.58 | $3,600 |\n  | Closing costs | $13,200 | $14,500 |\n\n  I signed the intent to proceed with both of your names. I did not resubmit the application.\n- **Documents:** I uploaded only what the lender asked for and submitted them to underwriting. That was 8 statements (last 2 for each of your four personal accounts) and 4 payslips (last 2 each). I did not share Nadia's business account.\n- **Condition 1, the $8,000 deposit on 9/3 into Sam's checking (ending 4417):** I asked you about it. I answered that it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment and not a loan.\n- **Condition 2, W-2s:** I uploaded both 2025 W-2s with the response.\n\nThe lender's status page shows \"response received\" for both conditions. There were no messages from the loan officer. The next step is underwriting's decision.",
